---
import BaseLayout from '@layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
import { projects } from '../data/projects';
---
<BaseLayout title="项目" activeNav="/projects" description="KBber 的 AI 工程项目，涵盖证据溯源、GraphRAG、Agent 记忆、强化学习和端侧部署。">
<section class="portfolio-home project-directory">
  <p class="eyebrow">ENGINEERING PROJECTS</p><h1>实现，是最好的说明。</h1>
  <p class="intro-description">从财报数字溯源到多轮 Agent 记忆。每个项目记录一个具体问题，以及解决它的技术路径。</p>
  <div class="work-grid">{projects.map(p=><a class="work-card" href={p.href}><span class="work-category">{p.category}</span><h2>{p.title}</h2><p>{p.description}</p><div class="work-stack">{p.stack.map(s=><span>{s}</span>)}</div><span class="repo-name">{p.name}</span></a>)}</div>
  <div class="local-work"><h2>本地探索</h2><p><strong>TenderGuard v0.4</strong> · 招投标合规审核，结合混合检索、规则引擎与人工复核。</p><p><strong>PosePilot</strong> · 离线拍照姿势工具，按场景组织动作示意与手机机位。</p><p><strong>vibe-knowledge-film</strong> · 从文案生成字幕、分镜与动效代码的视频制作 Skill。</p></div>
</section>
</BaseLayout>
